      "prompt_hash": "a4abe9da96b84bc5",
      "draft": "Jessa Rook looked at the boots in Nicco's outstretched hands, then back at his face. Her expression remained composed, but a faint line appeared between her brows. \"You just got here,\" she said, her low voice even. \"You don't know what you'll need.\"\n\nShe made no move to take them. Her gaze flickered over his feet, assessing the state of whatever he currently wore. \"I have boots. Those were for you. A man walking into Heartstone needs proper footwear, not charity going the wrong way.\" She gave a small, firm shake of her head, her hands staying at her sides. The offer was refused.",
